  "remarks": "TAi.110 Designation: Chief Justice of Supreme Court under the Taliban regime (1996-2001). Passport no: Afghanistan diplomatic passport D0009914, issued in Afghanistan, issued 10 May 2022, expires 10 May 2027. (Name in Latin script: Noor Mohammed Saqeb; name original script: نورمحمد ثاقب). Member of Taliban Supreme Council and Head of Taliban Religious Committee. Belongs to Ahmadzai tribe. Height: 175 cm; Listing: Listed on 25 January 2001 (amended on 3 Sep 2003, 21 Sep 2007, 29 Nov. 2011, 10 Mar. 2026, 28 Apr. 2026)",
